cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the software (this repository) and the associated article."
title: "Hue Heritage Visitors Forecasting: horizon-specific model selection for daily visitor demand at Hue Imperial Citadel heritage sites"
abstract: >-
  Data, code and results supporting a study of daily visitor forecasting at three
  UNESCO World Heritage sites of the Complex of Hue Monuments (Imperial City,
  Minh Mang Tomb, Khai Dinh Tomb), Viet Nam. Eight forecasting models are
  compared across 1-, 7- and 30-day horizons over 10 random seeds, with
  Diebold-Mariano tests, Model Confidence Set analysis, probabilistic evaluation
  of Temporal Fusion Transformer quantiles, SHAP-based interpretation and
  computational cost profiling.
type: software
